  dialogues:
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'Is this like that show Home, M.D.? So I''m patient good-looking
      and I''m experiencing [symptoms]! '
    doctorResponsePositive: Seems criticial, good-looking!
    patientReactionPositive: Only you can make go back home, Doctor!
    doctorResponseNegative: I don't think this is the time for doing this.
    patientReactionNegative: Way to ruin the show.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'So, I woke up feeling [symptoms] and thought, ''This could be
      my big transformation arc! '
    doctorResponsePositive: "Tell me more! Any new powers\u2014er, I mean, symptoms?"
    patientReactionPositive: Just that!
    doctorResponseNegative: You're no hero and you'll end up in the corpo rat race
      like the rest of us.
    patientReactionNegative: Huh...?
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'I''ve got all this [symptoms], do you think I''ll be the start
      of a zombie apocalypse?! '
    doctorResponsePositive: Let's make sure you don't! They'll have to go against
      your zombie powers.
    patientReactionPositive: They won't stand a chance!
    doctorResponseNegative: I hope not.
    patientReactionNegative: Ugh.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'I was feeling fine, then BAM! [symptoms] hit me hard! '
    doctorResponsePositive: Sounds like an insane plot twist.
    patientReactionPositive: Definitely!
    doctorResponseNegative: Yeah, yeah.
    patientReactionNegative: '?'
